            <value>
               <exData contentType="text/html">
                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">INSTRUCTIONS:<span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>Additional information is needed to explain your parents’<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">            </span>federal income tax filing status.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span>Before we can determine financial need, we need verification from the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) that your parents did not file a Federal Income Tax Return for<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">           </span>. See definition of a parent below.</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:none"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></span></p><p style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Incomplete documents will not be returned. They will be disposed of in a secure manner, per university policy. This will delay processing.</p></body>
               </exData>
            </value>
            <font typeface="Calibri" baselineShift="0pt"/>
            <margin topInset="0.5mm" bottomInset="0.5mm" leftInset="0.5mm" rightInset="0.5mm"/>
